$ enola baseline frobnicate
exit: 2
--- stdout
--- stderr
enola: no mcp-arch.yaml in <TMP>, using built-in defaults
enola baseline: unknown action "frobnicate"
Usage: enola baseline <pin|show|clear> [config_path]

  pin    freeze the current .enola snapshot as the diff baseline
  show   report whether a baseline exists, what it describes, and whether check
         can grade against it (exit 3 when it cannot)
  clear  remove the pinned baseline
